  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3db1de12d5a0e3327fe518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c82872d8a468c7ad7b36546080de7121f477614ca965a9aed5b1ce585843d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73e4ac7247b872fde5065998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b8214d3750432ce174fdd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你坐在副驾驶座的反应\r\n还真有趣呢……\r\n会让我想要开得再更快一点呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08200f4dd2c72d88b173041654119cdcf43b776bf1ae8f678819b0e5e41b3bdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8626ecd6844a8ce0e9f354e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是兜风还是比赛，\r\n我都会用超快速度带你到目的地。\r\n你可要好～好地待在我身边哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba810fbdb7da8b7c2c19ce7d5addef85ab9dd108ed4ba47d0697c30b3e83cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d298225ec7507e740ae5d63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年也想和训练员一起\r\n共度很棒的一整年呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "289119cb66dcef521cd2e02c2c6b8c60af5607cc8c00b0364409781af0dc8820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98244a9efccec24969a80641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈给了我巧克力，\r\n说是要感谢平时的照顾呢！\r\n大家真的都很可爱呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1cf331300ee6204e954005d7c4d3aa2f9aae4c2093d90a16824688f5891f097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e729181e3b7e8de328d461a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你，我亲手做的巧克力！\r\n里面包着我满满的爱心哦～\r\n这样你就对我更死心塌地了吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f02ecc8f1bdae51858629465126a169d2cd2712aa3aedd4c9ddb94020ba20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e37d33d0cb6964a08f6ae4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道可以清楚看见星星的地方哦。\r\n虽然有点远……但难得的七夕嘛，\r\n要不要开车去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba30b2608d9f421fc8a17b66711f021a28cbcc900448ae3ba6bfdaf296da16a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0184eab4c5cd8015d15e2502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐！比起吃点心，\r\n恶作剧好像更有趣呢……！\r\n开玩笑的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e5ac5b011aa96865e275755e38c415007ca8cec292923aa92b3accdd3b9a13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74d17f233bb3eeca9f78962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐♪\r\n神圣的夜晚果然\r\n很令人兴奋呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1553a66cc9c416a4ae4bfdee10feabde7aba967801c467df3ffa0615ecf8e13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0a0cd421e98690d9882d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢兜风，\r\n但悠闲地看彩灯也很棒呢。\r\n……今晚你有空吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52253a58795d1d07167c1356f7a3c0bf44b4dc24fec1a52c480a7275fc0a3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad433af67f642884421158c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是最棒的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8632b2475932891975d71f310c3bd7ac9bb48498542a79d87ff9ca6091b27805",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4e741f9cddf404526191df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也快要过完了呢……\r\n自从遇见训练员之后，\r\n时间就过得好快呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a84f8b158faec6a00aeacb1388f6aa3692af7e5dd5e09cf1ab27e83c0672692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb805c5ed517669a1977d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，你希望我为你做什么呢？\r\n难得你生日嘛，\r\n都跟姐姐说说看♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e2f768565b06d405a0cb3295d634206d26ee5ff208c4d6fcd804d9277d31f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f123a02c5881c9dc7fa213d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n呵呵……你好像变得更可靠了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee1cc924452d898062c6e82186731342bd78e1060a781c41bf0dd067fe66afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8362f12cbeec42410ba87de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可爱的后辈们给了我\r\n好多的祝贺呢！\r\n呵呵，生日真是美好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "98709cafe93c0d8f5adb40a0af8b5f0345e8da2d8bf26c5855e1e52e3274ec1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b37e6566fb37fabe7ba14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把今天的行程整个空下来了。\r\n……所以，你可以整天都\r\n帮我庆祝生日吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba334368020ce36c6090b8dcef6b9189f3e6abbbc28283a6ee9f4dc62c10b2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540a012f2a943b81b95f1293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告呢。\r\n你看过之后再告诉我\r\n是什么事吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09366842b7c906cad725b306ed0b23f46634d1a00dede9d840526e99ef316185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58aab3c13660a18a01339c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了呢。\r\n不知道是什么东西，\r\n好期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd57eb4c038df89baa9594f2aae95c03743dbcc01a6f121e7f0e25596e8e60a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af090746d4be799cf5eca313",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像达成了哦♪\r\n真不愧是训练员呢，\r\n那我就带你去兜风当作奖励吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9545e4ce2323d135000918ca22262473770dc2f01443e65ea45b3f84902028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:357f29fac9c096727c0f335e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在准备举办活动呢。\r\n训练员要记得把行程空出来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef0f620d130cc9acff208a30148145d19a12ed37df14de0e727c1f6bed326f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95aa02b9dbe70c29abf2fa64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动呢。\r\n喂喂，我们赶快过去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21916b6af41c76589b9d4a7c327ec2bb8d553d87ab87d550bfb942117f59078c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62419e2fe978b04c7687bf85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be75ef2ceadfbe7d34c8257778aca5e9e8d5eec946d714bf77f49a6d0dd375da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e11e2907f9452b2c50527c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8e74a358d0923d64c7f7f7b8c2dfe7be75620364ffe94d8f3945ced08f90a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb022bdc606d7fb95aefe00e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像制作人一样把针织衫披在肩膀上\r\n真的很酷炫对吧？\r\n时下流行的穿搭问我就对了?",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0c9a3b23beac0d34a02909d3aa6f9577f70bdf5f2016e2aaec182f7ce91b56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec764cfcf4d3cb170d513f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我约会时一定会穿上这套衣服，\r\n或许可以说是另一套决胜服？\r\n……跟你说笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da360a861ccc29e3ccd4498d5315246b17ec80a591fed0aad72516c84594db16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f852a30d0d6076fa40b9bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近热衷于周游高速公路休息站！\r\n但却始终找不到\r\n有卖汉堡的自动贩卖机呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b817c2185fc87063e64f387d23937300feda321e2d7c73392f4a2f69eefad341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04874e679190d10f934849d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手，太热血了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153368fceb79072c1211dd3d8f958d311caab6daabdba2320a77bd246a3689b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43b6dd5d5d63b3c67cd9773",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb827ebfa4a18f8a78bf6294b1a43d24dab38fb6d3a9f37700d6ec824589818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a6001d5ab10c6a750c0297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我输了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be75ef2ceadfbe7d34c8257778aca5e9e8d5eec946d714bf77f49a6d0dd375da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1edbc30890b226f92117fa7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手，太热血了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5153368fceb79072c1211dd3d8f958d311caab6daabdba2320a77bd246a3689b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006f18015667863ea345bb59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新最高分了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb1200d4604d70b9cb553975ed9225912b9c84da59e3bf28712b2ed3438f6df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2063fc60eb294b705ce78b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起来一场开心的比赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "687e9b20541c2fd32d3a4391dcd5fb9b99606f8163c17c19d2a87e93a902f94e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e4d1bbede656a216b4b89c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c7335655d8b1b327022c54c53c9cb3f485d4806f12eea786b94bc17387bcbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
